Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.28,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Si te levantas despeinado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.20,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿peinas el espejo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:02.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}o te peinas tú?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.93,0:00:03.76,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Parece una tontería
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:03.91,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.91,0:00:04.90,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}es lo que tú haces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:06.01,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}cada día cuando quieres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.01,0:00:06.86,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que cambie tu vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:07.61,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}sin cambiar tú
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.61,0:00:08.42,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}El espejo es como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:09.74,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la vida y solamente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:10.90,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te puede devolver aquello
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:11.75,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que le enseñas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.75,0:00:13.25,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Fulano quiere estar mejor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:14.16,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero se pasa todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:15.42,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}el día agobiado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:16.85,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de mala hostia y quejándose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:18.03,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Mirando lo que le falta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.03,0:00:18.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de si la gente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.37,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que si sus compañeros
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:21.36,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que si el trabajo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:21.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que esto está muy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:22.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}caro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:23.24,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Quiere que su vida cambie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:23.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero llega a casa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:24.80,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y le muestra la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:25.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de alguien desesperado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:26.89,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de alguien agobiado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:27.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de mala hostia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.73,0:00:29.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y la vida simplemente refleja
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:29.89,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}eso mismo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:30.96,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Pero Mengano pilló el juego
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:32.12,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y empezó a aplicarlo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.12,0:00:32.77,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}a su favor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:33.84,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Empezó a cuidarse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:35.14,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}empezó a hablarse bien
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:35.76,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y empezó a dejar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:36.43,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de quejarse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:37.54,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por lo que la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:38.23,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}no le daba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:39.37,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y empezó a comportarse como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:40.80,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}alguien que se siente capaz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:41.48,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y que ya se siente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:42.21,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}suficiente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.21,0:00:43.62,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y el espejo no tuvo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:45.57,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}más remedio que devolverle esa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:46.31,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}misma imagen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:47.22,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}El espejo o la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.22,0:00:48.03,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}no entienden nada
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:49.40,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}simplemente te reflejan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:50.54,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y te devuelven todo aquello
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.54,0:00:51.63,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que tú das y emanas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:52.12,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Por tanto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:53.02,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}cambia por dentro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:53.78,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y lo de fuera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:54.57,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}se tiene que adaptar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:55.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por consecuencia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:55.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Así que hoy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:56.85,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}cada vez que te pilles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:57.43,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}quejándote
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.43,0:00:58.33,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Cámbialo por algo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:00:59.56,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que realmente agradezcas
